---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ReviewNote from '@/components/ReviewNote.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';

const entity = site.legalEntity ?? site.name;
const LAST_UPDATED = '21 October 2026';
const analyticsOn = !!site.analyticsToken;
const turnstileOn = !!site.turnstileSiteKey;
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Ilelah Technologies collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website."
  heading="Privacy policy"
  intro={`How ${site.name} handles the personal information you share with us through this website.`}
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy/' }]}
  cta={false}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="fine">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>

        <ReviewNote>This policy is a draft prepared for a website that collects enquiries only. Have it reviewed by a qualified legal professional against the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and NDPC guidance before launch. Confirm the legal entity name, retention periods and processors. See docs/PRIVACY_REVIEW.md.</ReviewNote>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by {entity} ("we", "us"), a technology business {site.location.display.replace('Based', 'based')}.
          We are responsible for the personal information collected through this website.
        </p>
        {site.registrationNumber && <p>Registration number: {site.registrationNumber}.</p>}
        <ReviewNote>Insert the exact CAC-registered entity name in src/config/site.ts (legalEntity) once confirmed. Add the registration number only if you want it published.</ReviewNote>
        <p>
          To contact us about privacy, email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or call {site.contact.phoneDisplay}.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <h3>Information you give us</h3>
        <p>When you send an enquiry, quote request, demonstration request or training enquiry, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>your name, email address and, if you provide them, your phone or WhatsApp number and organisation</li>
          <li>your country</li>
          <li>the service or course you are interested in, and what you tell us about your needs</li>
          <li>an approximate budget and timeline, if you choose to give them</li>
          <li>how you would like us to contact you</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Please do not include sensitive personal information, such as health details or identity numbers, or other people's personal data, in your message.</p>
        <p>If you contact us by email, phone or WhatsApp, we receive the information you share through that channel.</p>

        <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical information.</strong> When you use the website, our hosting provider processes technical
            information such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to deliver the site and keep it secure.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Spam and abuse protection.</strong> When you submit a form, we use your IP address to limit repeated
            submissions.{turnstileOn && ' A security check from Cloudflare (Turnstile) also helps confirm that the form is being used by a person and not an automated program.'}
          </li>
          {analyticsOn && (
            <li>
              <strong>Visitor statistics.</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page visits. It does not use
              cookies, and we cannot use it to identify you.
            </li>
          )}
        </ul>
        <p>This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>to reply to your enquiry and discuss your needs</li>
          <li>to prepare a quote, proposal, demonstration or training arrangement you have asked for</li>
          <li>to keep a record of our correspondence with you</li>
          <li>to protect the website and our forms from spam and misuse</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use enquiry details to send you marketing.</p>

        <h2>Our lawful basis</h2>
        <p>
          We process enquiry information because you have asked us to respond and agreed to us using your details for that
          purpose, and, where you are considering working with us, to take steps at your request before entering into a
          contract. We process technical information on the basis of our legitimate interest in running a secure and
          reliable website.
        </p>
        <ReviewNote>Confirm the lawful bases with your legal adviser.</ReviewNote>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>We share personal information only with service providers who help us run this website and handle enquiries:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>: website hosting, security{turnstileOn ? ', the form security check' : ''}{analyticsOn ? ' and visitor statistics' : ''}.</li>
          <li><strong>Resend</strong>: delivers the details you submit through our forms to our business inbox.</li>
          <li><strong>Our email provider</strong>: stores the enquiry emails we receive.</li>
        </ul>
        <ReviewNote>Name your mailbox provider (e.g. Zoho Mail or Google Workspace) once chosen.</ReviewNote>
        <p>We may also disclose information where the law requires it.</p>

        <h2>International transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Some of our service providers process information outside Nigeria, including in the United States and Europe. We
          use reputable providers that apply recognised security and data protection safeguards.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry correspondence for as long as needed to respond and, if we work together, for the length of our
          working relationship and any period required for legal, accounting or record-keeping purposes. Enquiries that do
          not lead to work are deleted after 24 months.
        </p>
        <ReviewNote>Confirm the 24-month retention period, and that you will actually delete old enquiries on that schedule.</ReviewNote>

        <h2>How we protect it</h2>
        <p>
          The website is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). Form submissions are checked and delivered by a
          secure server-side process, and access to our business inbox is protected. No method of transmission or storage
          is completely secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and other laws that may apply to you, you can ask us to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>confirm whether we hold personal information about you and give you a copy</li>
          <li>correct information that is inaccurate or incomplete</li>
          <li>delete your information, or restrict how we use it</li>
          <li>provide your information in a commonly used format</li>
          <li>stop processing it, or withdraw your consent at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To make a request, contact us using the details above. We may need to confirm your identity first. If you are not
          satisfied with our response, you can complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission or the data protection
          authority where you live.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This website is intended for adults and organisations. We do not knowingly collect personal information from
          children through it. Student information that schools share with us as part of a school project is handled under
          a separate agreement with the school.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy as our website or services change. The date at the top shows when it was last updated.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
